/-!
# Indexed witnesses for the labelled max2 forest

Each node stores its mask, its parent position and its actor index.
The parent position is earlier for every nonroot node.
The array view is checked against the published mask lists. The roots,
parent inequalities and actor bounds below certify only the combinatorics;
the proposed conjugation equations and square-one coverage are separate
mathematical obligations.

The witnesses are copied from FiberCensus/source/forest.json, generated from
the original ATLAS J4G1-max2W1 matrices. Attribution and reproduction details
are in FiberCensus/source/README.md. Source motivation: Aschbacher--Smith,
refs/quasithin.pdf, printed pp.64--65, A.6.1--4.
-/

